     "形式"
    ],
    "en": [
     "Class"
    ]
   },
   "value": {
    "ja": [
     "DL-45 形（Wikidata に車両の項目は無く、阿里山林業鉄路 Q708937 に結んだ）"
    ],
    "en": [
     "DL-45 class (no Wikidata item for the locomotives; linked to the Alishan Forest Railway, Q708937)"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "ja": [
     "車両の種類"
    ],
    "en": [
     "Car type"
    ]
   },
   "value": {
    "ja": [
     "片運転台のボンネット型ディーゼル機関車（30 t、750 馬力）。いまの本線の阿里山号を引く。"
    ],
    "en": [
     "An end-cab hood diesel locomotive (30 t, 750 hp) that hauls today's main-line Alishan trains."
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "ja": [
     "塗装"
    ],
    "en": [
     "Livery"
    ]
   },
   "value": {
    "ja": [
     "阿里山林業鉄路の赤に白い帯、ボンネットの端の白い V 字、黒い台枠"
    ],
    "en": [
     "AFR red with a white band, white V chevrons on the hood ends, black frame"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "ja": [
     "模型の寸法"
    ],
    "en": [
     "Model size"
    ]
